      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T03:39:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that this commit adds the same two negative scenarios, could the existing test case `Verify LDAP ReadOnly User Cannot Change Local User Password` be removed? The two cases below already cover the scenarios currently verified by the existing test:\n\n```robot\n${privilege_admin}       LDAP_ReadOnly    Fail\n${privilege_readonly}    LDAP_ReadOnly    Fail\n```\n\nThis would avoid duplicate coverage and keep all local-user password change authorization scenarios in a single test.",
